        "text": "Widespread changes have been observed, including damage to coral reefs and mangroves that support ocean life, and migration of species to higher latitudes and altitudes where the water could be cooler. Latest estimates from UNESCO warn that more than half of the world's marine species may stand on the brink of extinction by 2100.",
